.env
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.streamlit/secrets.toml
.DS_Store

# Output of scripts/validate_answer_key.py — a record of one live run, and
# different on every run. Regenerate rather than tracking the churn.
scorecard.json

# Saved results, keyed by account + model + data fingerprint. The
# investigations are shared: the fingerprint is a content hash of the
# committed transactions.csv rows, so a teammate's checkout computes the
# same file names and opens every account with its verdict already there.
# Decisions are shared for the same reason: one per flagged account, keyed
# by the same fingerprint, so the recommendation is there without a call.
# Comparisons and chats stay local — a re-run or personal.
.cache/*
!.cache/investigations/
!.cache/decisions/

# Third-party datasets used to calibrate the synthetic generator (e.g. UCI
# Online Retail II, 43 MB). Downloaded by script, never committed.
data/external/

# Generated training data — a function of seed + data/calibration/generator.json.
# Regenerates in about a minute with scripts/generate_training_data.py.
data/synthetic/

# Trained model artefacts — rebuilt by scripts/train_leak_classifier.py.
# models/

hackathon.txt
notebooks/

methodology_detailed.md
methodology.md
presentation.md